  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Department of Energy, Seismic Cooperation Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The award funds U.S. National Laboratory and U.S. university expert engagement building seismic monitoring capacity with institutes in the Middle East, the Caucasus, and Central Asia. Outreach includes training, joint data analysis, seismometer deployment and performance improvement, and collaborative research and data analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
